// SHCBookingService lets Spectra SHC book its patients' visits into RIS.
//
// A visit is one trip to a center: one RIS appointment per procedure, all
// at the same center and time, tagged with SHC's booking reference so they
// can be found again. SHC follows what happens next on the APPOINTMENT
// stream (appointment.status_changed, .updated, .deleted, and report.*).
//
// It is for services, not browsers: calls carry
// "authorization: Bearer <MS_APPOINTMENT_SHC_TOKEN>" metadata.

